---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="RevueAura is an editorial lifestyle magazine exploring the quiet currents of style, beauty, home, technology, and outdoor living.">
  <Header />
  <main class="container">
    <article class="prose about-page">
      <header class="page-head">
        <span class="tag">About</span>
        <h1>An editorial magazine, written slowly.</h1>
      </header>

      <p>RevueAura is a lifestyle magazine that takes the long view. Across five sections — Fashion, Beauty, Living, Tech, and Outdoors — we publish considered essays, cultural notes, and slow reads for readers who want more than recommendations.</p>

      <p>We don't publish buying guides. We don't rank products. We don't chase trends. We write about how things feel — what a morning ritual does to the texture of a day, what a slow-fashion wardrobe asks of its wearer, what it means to make a home an extension of mood rather than a checklist.</p>

      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Long-form essays</strong> — 1500 to 2200 words, read at your own pace.</li>
        <li><strong>Five editorial desks</strong> — fashion, beauty, home, tech, outdoors — each treated with the same editorial weight.</li>
        <li><strong>A reading-first experience</strong> — no popups, no affiliate noise, no urgency.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What you won't find</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No "best of" round-ups.</li>
        <li>No product comparison tables.</li>
        <li>No sponsored placements.</li>
        <li>No "buy now" CTAs.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>The work is written by a small editorial team. The pace is deliberate. The voice is consistent. The aim is simple: a magazine that respects your attention.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 36px 0;
  }

  .page-head {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .page-head h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
  }
</style>